%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a996e19c4d83684a905dbed745d44a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: SOCutscene_Feed_FirstMalicious
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIandCinematic.SOCutscene
  _endBlendSeconds: 1
  _steps:
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "저기 빨간색 피드 보이지?"
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uCF54\uB9AC"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "응. 다른 피드랑 색이 다르네?"
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "저건 악성 미끼 피드야. 사람들이 누르게 하려고 그럴듯하게 꾸며 놓은 거지."
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uCF54\uB9AC"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "근데 저게 길을 막고 있잖아?"
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "맞아. 저 뒤에 우리가 필요한 제목 재료가 있어. 저걸 먼저 없애야 해."
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uCF54\uB9AC"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "어떻게 없애는데?"
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "악성 피드마다 없애는 방법이 달라. 일단 가까이 가 봐. 내가 알려 줄게!"
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "그리고 조심해! 없애는 순간 악성 데이터가 튀어나와 널 쫓아올 거야."
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uCF54\uB9AC"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "알겠어. 조심해서 가 볼게."
    ShouldRunTime: 0
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
